---
import SolutionPage from '../../layouts/SolutionPage.astro';
---

<SolutionPage
  title="Environmental Health"
  parent="Mitigate"
  oneliner="Your environment is dictating your biology 24/7 whether you notice or not."
  slug="environment"
  showSolutionPath={false}
  showDisclaimer={false}
>
  <!-- ── Why this matters ── -->
  <h2>Why This Matters</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>Light, air, water, EMF, and grounding are high-leverage biological inputs — they change the dose-response of every other protocol you run</li>
    <li>Modern indoor environments are poorly matched to human biology: artificial light suppresses melatonin, tap water delivers endocrine disruptors, indoor air routinely exceeds outdoor pollution levels</li>
    <li>Small, targeted environmental interventions produce compounding benefit across every 4M pillar — sleep, cognition, hormones, and gut health all improve downstream</li>
  </ul>

  <!-- ── Shop by Sub-Category ── -->
  <h2 id="environment-categories">Shop by Category</h2>
  <p>Five environmental factors. Each has curated protocol-matched products. Click in to explore and purchase.</p>
  <div class="env-grid">
    <a href="/solutions/environment/light" class="env-card">
      <div class="env-icon">☀</div>
      <h3>Light</h3>
      <p>Circadian-friendly bulbs, blue-blockers, red-light therapy, and morning light protocols.</p>
      <span class="env-cta">Explore Products →</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/solutions/environment/air" class="env-card">
      <div class="env-icon">💨</div>
      <h3>Air</h3>
      <p>HEPA + carbon filtration, mold testing, and indoor air quality interventions.</p>
      <span class="env-cta">Explore Products →</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/solutions/environment/water" class="env-card">
      <div class="env-icon">💧</div>
      <h3>Water</h3>
      <p>Reverse osmosis, whole-home filtration, shower filters, and replacement schedules.</p>
      <span class="env-cta">Explore Products →</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/solutions/environment/emf" class="env-card">
      <div class="env-icon">⚡</div>
      <h3>EMF</h3>
      <p>Shielding bedding, faraday cases, low-EMF routers, and distance-based strategies.</p>
      <span class="env-cta">Explore Products →</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/solutions/environment/grounding" class="env-card">
      <div class="env-icon">🌿</div>
      <h3>Grounding</h3>
      <p>Sleep mats, floor mats, grounding patches, and outdoor grounding protocols.</p>
      <span class="env-cta">Explore Products →</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- ── Condensed Insulting Behaviors ── -->
  <h2>The Insulting Behaviors</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>LED overhead lighting in the bedroom and living areas all night — blue-spectrum suppresses melatonin production</li>
    <li>Drinking unfiltered tap water — fluoride, chlorine, PFAS, and microplastics delivered daily</li>
    <li>Constant EMF immersion — router in the bedroom, phone in the pocket all day, sleeping next to chargers</li>
    <li>Feet never touching earth — modern footwear and flooring eliminate grounding, a measurable anti-inflammatory input</li>
  </ul>

  <a href="/blog/eliminate-the-insulting-behavior-environment" class="blog-deepdive-btn">
    Read More: Eliminate the Insulting Behavior — Environment →
  </a>

  <!-- ── Optional Protégé footer ── -->
  <div class="protege-card">
    Want a personalized environmental + supplement protocol? <strong>Become a Protégé (free)</strong> — the My4MLife App includes environmental coaching by week.
    <a href="https://app.my4mlife.com" class="protege-link">Join My4MLife →</a>
  </div>
</SolutionPage>

<style>
/* 5-card environment grid */
.env-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
  margin: 1rem 0 2.5rem;
}
.env-card {
  background: var(--bg-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.5rem 1.1rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: border-color 0.18s, box-shadow 0.18s, transform 0.18s;
}
.env-card:hover {
  border-color: var(--accent);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,184,148,0.15);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}
.env-icon {
  font-size: 1.6rem;
  line-height: 1;
  margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
}
.env-card h3 {
  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin: 0;
}
.env-card p {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: var(--text-light);
  margin: 0;
  flex: 1;
}
.env-cta {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 0.6rem;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--accent);
}

/* Blog deep-dive link styled as button */
.blog-deepdive-btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 1rem 0 2rem;
  padding: 0.55rem 1.4rem;
  background: var(--bg-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: 999px;
  color: var(--accent);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
}
.blog-deepdive-btn:hover {
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
}

/* Protégé footer */
.protege-card {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,54,93,0.05) 0%, rgba(0,184,148,0.06) 100%);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  color: var(--text);
  margin: 0 0 1rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  align-items: center;
}
.protege-link {
  color: var(--accent);
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.protege-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
